}, "order": 30}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"shape": 6, "name": "STRING", "links": [155], "label": "字符串", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "字符串"}], "size": [308.04949951171875, 331.0021057128906], "pos": [-3783.9931640625, -2213.822998046875], "widgets_values": ["这是一个五颜六色的中国风格的插图，描绘了一个穿着华丽的花卉图案长袍的大胡子男人，拿着带有茶壶和鱼的托盘，并读了一本书。他戴着一顶鲜花装饰的黑色和红色帽子。周围是三个穿着蓝色和红色传统服装的小孩，一个孩子站在他的右边，左边有两个孩子。背景具有蓝天，蓬松的白色云层，底部有粉红色和黄色花的边界。汉字在左边垂直写。整体风格是异想天开和节日的。", "这幅数字绘画描绘了一个宁静而坚定的战士，在漩涡状和云层中站立。该主题是长长的，长长的黑发，在高高的马尾辫中造型，穿着传统的深绿色和服，带有白色的内层和黑色的obi腰带。他们的右手握着一把长长的剑，向下指着。相机角度略低于眼睛水平，从而增强了受试者的势力。薄雾的背景柔软，灰白色，营造出一种神秘的空灵氛围。战士的平静表达与和服和周围的雾的动态运动形成鲜明对比。整体风格具有幻想的触感，重点是纹理和运动。"], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 9, "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {}, "id": 13, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-custom-scripts", "ver": "aac13aa7ce35b07d43633c3bbe654a38c00d74f5", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 23}, {"outputs": [{"name": "CLIP", "slot_index": 0, "links": [136, 146], "label": "CLIP", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "CLIP"}], "color": "#223", "widgets_values": ["umt5_xxl_fp16.safetensors", "wan", "default"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "CLIPLoader", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#335", "size": [485.94415283203125, 106], "pos": [-3291.681640625, -1966.33642578125], "id": 124, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.46", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CLIPLoader"}, "order": 4}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"shape": 6, "name": "text", "links": [1, 8, 126], "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "size": [492.14044189453125, 277], "color": "rgba(38, 73, 116, 0.7)", "pos": [-5122.5888671875, -2149.876953125], "widgets_values": ["Descriptive", "long", 512, 0.9, 0, 0.6, ""], "inputs": [{"name": "image", "link": 103, "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"name": "joycaption_beta1_model", "link": 3, "label": "joycaption_beta1_model", "type": "JOYCAPTIONBETA1_MODEL", "localized_name": "joycaption_beta1_model"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "extra_options", "link": 4, "label": "extra_options", "type": "JoyCaption2ExtraOption", "localized_name": "extra_options"}, {"widget": {"name": "user_prompt"}, "name": "user_prompt", "link": 156, "label": "user_prompt", "type": "STRING"}], "flags": {}, "id": 4, "type": "LayerUtility: JoyCaptionBeta1", "properties": {"cnr_id": "ComfyUI_LayerStyle_Advance", "ver": "0f9184100e626e3202568a7cf890b3b92685a168", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "LayerUtility: JoyCaptionBeta1"}, "order": 19}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#872639", "widgets_values": ["JoyCaption Beta One 提供多种生成模式，以满足不同的需求，Descriptive Caption 和 Straightforward 是最有用的，其他模式很有趣，但不太稳定。\n\n我们一起来了解下：\n\nDescriptive Caption 以正式或随意的语气为图像编写描述性标题\nStraightforward Caption 比 Descriptive 更简洁、客观的风格。\nStable Diffusion Prompt 尝试模仿用户通常编写 Stable Diffusion 提示的方式，混合使用自然语言和类似 booru 的标签。\nMidJourney 类似于 Training Prompt 模式，但更像 MidJourney 提示。\nDanbooru tag list 写入镜像的 Danbooru 标签列表。\ne621 tag list 写入镜像的 e621 标签列表。\nRule34 tag list 写入镜像的 Rule34 标签列表。\nBooru-Like Tag List 类似于 Booru Tag List 模式，但会在 boorus 使用的严格标签列表之外写入。\nArt Critic Analysis 像艺术评论家一样撰写图像分析。\nProduct Listing 为图像编写 Product Listing 样式的标题。\nSocial Media Post 为图片撰写适合社交媒体帖子的标题。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#731225", "size": [503.553466796875, 331.3675231933594], "pos": [-5042.1953125, -1731.2679443359375], "id": 10, "properties": {}, "order": 5}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "joycaption_beta1_model", "links": [3], "label": "joycaption_beta1_model", "type": "JOYCAPTIONBETA1_MODEL", "localized_name": "joycaption_beta1_model"}], "size": [496.2208251953125, 118.81717681884766], "color": "rgba(38, 73, 116, 0.7)", "pos": [-5649.10546875, -2288.208740234375], "widgets_values": ["fancyfeast/llama-joycaption-beta-one-hf-llava", "nf4", "cuda"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "id": 1, "type": "LayerUtility: LoadJoyCaptionBeta1Model", "properties": {"cnr_id": "ComfyUI_LayerStyle_Advance", "ver": "0f9184100e626e3202568a7cf890b3b92685a168", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "LayerUtility: LoadJoyCaptionBeta1Model"}, "order": 6}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#1d7085", "widgets_values": ["如果图像中有人物/角色，则必须将其称为 {name}。\n不要包含有关无法更改的人物/角色的信息（如种族、性别等），但仍要包含可更改的属性（如发型）。\n包括有关照明的信息。\n包括有关摄像机角度的信息。\n包括有关是否有水印的信息。\n包括有关是否存在 JPEG 伪影的信息。\n如果是照片，您必须包含有关可能使用的相机以及光圈、快门速度、ISO 等详细信息的信息。\n不要包含任何性内容;保持 PG。\n不要提及图像的分辨率。\n您必须包含有关图像的主观审美质量的信息，从低到非常高。\n包括有关图像构图样式的信息，如引导线、三分法或对称性。\n请勿提及图像中的任何文本。\n指定景深以及背景是聚焦还是模糊。\n如果适用，请提及可能使用人工或自然光源。\n不要使用任何模棱两可的语言。\n包括图像是 sfw、suggestive 还是 nsfw。\n仅描述图像中最重要的元素。\n如果是艺术作品，请勿包含艺术家的姓名或作品名称。\n确定图像方向（纵向、横向或正方形）和纵横比（如果很明显）。\n使用粗俗的俚语和亵渎性语言，例如（但不限于）“fucking”、“slut”、“cock”等。\n不要使用礼貌的委婉语——倾向于使用直率、随意的措辞。\n包括有关任何人物/角色年龄的信息（如果适用）。\n说明图像是否描绘了极度特写、特写、中特写、中景、牛仔、中广角、广角或极广角。\n不要提及图像的情绪/感觉/等。\n明确指定有利位置高度（视线水平、低角度虫眼、鸟瞰、无人机、屋顶等）。\n如果有水印，一定要提。\n您的响应将被文本到图像模型使用，因此请避免使用无用的元短语，例如“此图像显示...”、“您正在查看...”等。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#095c71", "size": [700.4195556640625, 487.9577941894531], "pos": [-6592.31494140625, -1624.314453125], "id": 11, "properties": {}, "order": 7}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"shape": 6, "name": "STRING", "label": "字符串", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "字符串"}], "size": [432.19781494140625, 437.0179138183594], "pos": [-4431.97216796875, -2487.310302734375], "widgets_values": ["This is a colorful, traditional Chinese-style illustration depicting a large, bearded man in ornate, floral-patterned robes, holding a tray with a teapot and fish, and reading a book. He wears a black and red hat adorned with flowers. Surrounding him are three young children dressed in blue and red traditional attire, with one child standing on his right and two on his left. The background features a blue sky with fluffy white clouds, and a border of pink and yellow flowers at the bottom. Chinese characters are written vertically on the left. The overall style is whimsical and festive.", "This digital painting depicts a serene yet determined warrior standing amidst swirling mist and clouds. The subject, with long, flowing black hair styled in a high ponytail, wears a traditional dark green kimono with a white inner layer and a black obi belt. They hold a long, slender sword in their right hand, pointed downward. The camera angle is slightly below eye level, enhancing the subject's imposing presence. The misty background, with its soft, grayish-white tones, creates a mystical, ethereal atmosphere. The warrior's calm expression contrasts with the dynamic movement of their kimono and the mist around them. The overall style is realistic with a fantasy touch, focusing on texture and movement."], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 1, "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {}, "id": 3, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-custom-scripts", "ver": "aac13aa7ce35b07d43633c3bbe654a38c00d74f5", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 20}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "extra_option", "links": [4], "label": "extra_option", "type": "JoyCaption2ExtraOption", "localized_name": "extra_option"}], "size": [470.3999938964844, 706], "color": "rgba(38, 73, 116, 0.7)", "pos": [-6068.65771484375, -2144.566650390625], "widgets_values": [false, true, false, true, false, false, false, false, false, false, false, false, false, false, false, false, false, false, false, false, false, false, false, false, false, false, false, "wangdapao"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "id": 2, "type": "LayerUtility: JoyCaptionBeta1ExtraOptions", "properties": {"cnr_id": "ComfyUI_LayerStyle_Advance", "ver": "0f9184100e626e3202568a7cf890b3b92685a168", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "LayerUtility: JoyCaptionBeta1ExtraOptions"}, "order": 8}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [105, 159, 161], "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"name": "MASK", "label": "遮罩", "type":